      "headers": [
        "You already know",
        "Image formation analogue"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "MVP matrix pipeline (graphics)",
          "`K[R\\|t]` is the same composition, inverted in vision"
        ],
        [
          "Homogeneous coordinates",
          "Identical; the `1` linearizes perspective"
        ],
        [
          "2D Fourier / sampling (signal)",
          "Pixel grid is a 2D sampler; aliasing = moiré"
        ],
        [
          "Change of basis",
          "Extrinsics `[R\\|t]` is world-frame → camera-frame change of basis"
        ],
